story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the 2026 record so far on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids has run short, with April to May at 57% of normal and June to July at 53%. In 2025 the same middle came in at 64% in October to November and 49% in November to December. Since 1951, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years, more than any other pair. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, and grid 26807 got just 43% of normal.</p>"}
